XR的產量計劃，主要受智能手機市場日趨飽和以及來自中國手機廠商激烈競爭的影響。蘋果公司對此不予置評。\n撰文: Yoko Kubota (北京) / Takashi Mochizuki (東京) / Tripp Mickle 發自(三藩市)\n（本文版權歸道瓊斯公司所有，未經許可不得翻譯或轉載。）\n更多精彩文章：\nAPEC峰會 聯合公報首次“流產”\n特朗普對美中達成貿易協議持樂觀態度\n貿易爭端迫使中國推進農業現代化\n中美1年期國債利率已現倒掛，人民幣受壓\n中美交鋒APEC，貿易和防務議題首當其沖", "external_links": ["https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-FIN-20181119151616&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119085440&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119122701&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119091029", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119122701", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119102427&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119085440", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-FIN-20181119151616", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119091029&quot;", "https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/UkBVRhVVwqkk5vawzwyvpQ--~A/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjtzbT0xO3c9NjA5O2g9NDA2/http://media.zenfs.com/en/homerun/feed_manager_auto_publish_494/c482b84350385d9dd9607adbaacb310d", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181119102427"], "published": "2018-11-20T10:00:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-11-20T10:52:31.001+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}